<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Prague bourse closed for Easter holiday.</title>
<headline>Prague bourse closed for Easter holiday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) did not trade on Monday as the country observes the Easter holiday.</p>
<p>On Friday, Czech shares were mixed with minor losses to several blue chips pulling the PX50 index down 0.1 point to 558.2.</p>
<p>The PSE will re-open on April 1.</p>
</text>
